Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.61,0:00:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,很久很久以前，在一个非常遥远的星系…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.91,0:00:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,《星球大战》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.41,0:00:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,《前传：西斯的复仇》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.41,0:00:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,战争！共和国在无情的西斯君王和杜库伯爵的攻击下逐渐粉碎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.41,0:01:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,两边都有强大的英雄，然而到处都充斥着邪恶
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.41,0:01:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在迅猛的攻势下，邪恶的帝国军首领格菲将军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.41,0:01:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,攻入了共和国首都…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.41,0:01:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,绑架了银河参议院的领导帕丁议长
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.41,0:01:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,正当分裂主义者帝国军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.05,0:01:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,尝试挟持他们手中宝贵的人质
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.68,0:01:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,从被包围的首都里逃脱时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.41,0:01:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,两名绝地武士拼死展开了拯救议长的任务…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.57,0:03:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,锁定他们，R2\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lock on to him, R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.07,0:03:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,师傅，格菲将军的船就在正前方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master, General Grievous's ship is directly ahead...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.61,0:03:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,与秃鹫机器人一起缓慢前进的那艘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the one crawling with vulture droids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.95,0:03:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,噢，我看到了，这下好办多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see it. Oh, this is going to be easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.13,0:03:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 亚伯，收到么？ - 收到，长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oddball, do you copy? - Copy, Red Leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.79,0:03:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,标记我的位置，带你的小队跟在我后上方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mark my position. Form your squad up behind me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.17,0:03:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在您后面了，肯诺比将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on your tail, General Kenobi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.17,0:03:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,S战机进入战斗列队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set S-foils in attack position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.02,0:03:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好戏要开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where the fun begins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.15,0:03:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们从我们中间穿过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let them pass between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.92,0:04:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我被盯上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all over me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.17,0:04:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快帮我…    - 我过去支援他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get them off my... - I'm gonna go help them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.30,0:04:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不，让他们吸引火力，我们干我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. They are doing their job so we can do ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.65,0:04:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,导弹！爬升！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Missiles. Pull up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没打中我们 - 又绕回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They overshot us. - They're coming around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.25,0:04:48.03,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的，R4 不要这样，别玩高难度动作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, R4. No, no. Nothing too fancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.30,0:04:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,放松所有能量，R2，准备倒转推进器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surge all power units, R2. Stand by reverse thrusters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.52,0:05:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定了，R2！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got 'em, R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.74,0:05:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,飞行真不是人干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flying is for droids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.96,0:05:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我中弹了，阿纳金？ - 看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm hit. Anakin?   - I see them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是蜂式机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buzz droids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.59,0:05:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,R4，小心，你那边有一个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R4, be careful. You have a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.10,0:05:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,噢，天啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.60,0:05:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他们正试图关闭所有控制开关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're shutting down all the controls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.52,0:05:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,往右边移一点，我帮你打掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move to the right so I can get a clear shot at them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.77,0:05:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,记得你的任务 去指挥船里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mission. Get to the command ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.07,0:05:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,去拯救议长，我这里已经没救了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the chancellor. I'm running out of tricks here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.70,0:06:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,噢，上帝啊…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the name of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别开火了！这么做没用的！ - 我也同意，真不是个好主意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold your fire! You're not helping. - I agree. Bad idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.38,0:06:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都看不到了，座舱里都是烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't see a thing. My cockpit's fogging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.43,0:06:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我被包围了，阿纳金！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're all over me. Anakin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.02,0:06:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 靠右一点 - 等等，这样我们俩都会没命的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move to the right. - Hold on. You'll get us both killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.40,0:06:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开这里，你在这里也没有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here. There's nothing more you can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.61,0:06:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,师傅，我不会离开你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not leaving without you, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定他，R2\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him, R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.67,0:06:50.05,Default,,0,0,0,,当心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,R2，射它中间的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2, hit the buzz droid's centre eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.23,0:07:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 太好了，你搞定它了 - 干得好，R2\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, you got him! - Great, R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.86,0:07:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,将军的指挥船就在前面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The general's command ship is dead ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.86,0:07:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你没看到保护罩还开着呢？！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you noticed the shields are still up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.03,0:07:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思，师傅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.58,0:07:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我有种不祥的预感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a bad feeling about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,在那儿，抓住他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There they are. Get them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.74,0:07:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,R2，找出议长在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2, locate the chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.58,0:08:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,议长的信号好象是从那里发出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chancellor's signal is coming from right there...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,尖顶上那个观察平台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the observation platform at the top of that spire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.55,0:08:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉到杜库伯爵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sense Count Dooku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我感觉到了圈套 - 下一步？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I sense a trap. - Next move?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.97,0:08:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,跳出这个圈套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spring the trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,R2，回去，我要你呆在船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2, go back. I need you to stay with the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.94,0:08:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,拿着这个，等我们的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Take this and wait for orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.16,0:08:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,船长，现在情况怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the situation, Captain?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.75,0:08:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,两个绝地武士在机库着陆了，我们正在跟踪他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two Jedi have landed in the main hangar bay. We're tracking them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.79,0:08:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,真让杜库伯爵说对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just as Count Dooku predicted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.18,0:08:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,破坏者！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroyers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.52,0:09:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,放下武器！我叫你们放下武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop your weapons. I said drop 'em.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.48,0:09:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 收到 - 收到，收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Roger. - Roger, roger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那些就是绝地武士的战机吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those are Jedi fighters all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.25,0:09:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你按停了？ - 没有啊，你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you press the stop button? - No. Did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.55,0:09:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,还有别的路可以出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's more than one way out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.59,0:09:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是要出去 让电梯动起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't want to get out. We want to get moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.93,0:09:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,R2，激活31174号电梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2, activate elevator 31174.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 听到么，R2 - 什么声音？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come in, R2. - What that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.93,0:09:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,R2，收到没？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,R2，激活电梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2, activate the elevator number 31174.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.27,0:09:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,回去干活吧，没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back to work. That nothin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.32,0:09:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,激活31174号电梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activate the elevator 31174.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,R2，我们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.08,0:10:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,总是那么冲动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always on the move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.08,0:10:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,R2，接通连线 R2，能听到么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2, switch on the comlink. R2, can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,R2？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,R2！R2！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2! R2!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.39,0:10:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,停下，我们要往上走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop. Stop. R2, we need to be going up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.52,0:10:24.39,Default,,0,0,0,,绝地武士，举起手来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hands up,Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.52,0:10:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,R2，你收到没有？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.81,0:10:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,R2，听到没有，我们要上，不是下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2, do you hear me? R2, we need to be going up, not down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.66,0:10:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿，你！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.25,0:10:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,对，这样子就对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你这个愚蠢的机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stupid little astro droid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:11:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,噢，是你啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.35,0:11:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我的眼睛！我的眼睛！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My eyes! My eyes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.27,0:11:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 刚刚怎么回事啊？ - R2他…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was that all about? - R2 has been...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不是他的错 - 我说什么了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No loose wire jokes. - Did I say anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.86,0:11:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他已经在努力了！ - 噢，我可什么都没说！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's trying. - I didn't say anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.44,0:11:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 议长 - 你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Chancellor. - Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,杜库伯爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Count Dooku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.66,0:12:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这次我们一起上 - 我正想这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This time we will do it together. - I was about to say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.46,0:12:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,找支援吧，你们不是他的对手，他是西斯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get help. You're no match for him. He's a Sith lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.47,0:12:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,帕丁议长，我们最擅长就是对付西斯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chancellor Palpatine, Sith lords are our speciality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.93,0:12:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,拿出你们的剑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your swords, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.93,0:12:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,在议长面前我们可不想打得太难看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't want to make a mess of things in front of the chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.52,0:12:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你这次别想逃了，杜库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't get away this time, Dooku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.58,0:12:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我也等了很久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been looking forward to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.79,0:12:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,伯爵，我的力量比上次见面提升了一倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My powers have doubled since the last time we met, Count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.08,0:12:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,很好，信心翻倍，失败也翻倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. Twice the pride, double the fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.65,0:13:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.88,0:13:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉得到你的恐惧，天行者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sense great fear in you, Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你憎恨，你愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have hate. You have anger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.81,0:13:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你没有好好利用它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you don't use them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.37,0:14:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good, Anakin. Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.76,0:14:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.39,0:14:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我不可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shouldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.73,0:14:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,快！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.87,0:14:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你干得太棒了，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did well, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.54,0:14:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,把他留在世上太危险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was too dangerous to be kept alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.91,0:14:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，但是他已经是阶下囚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but he was an unarmed prisoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.42,0:14:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我不该那么做的，绝地武士不该那样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shouldn't have done that. It's not the Jedi way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.13,0:14:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这很平常的，他斩了你的手臂，你杀了他报仇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is only natural. He cut off your arm, and you wanted revenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.63,0:14:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是第一次了，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't the first time, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.76,0:15:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得你告诉我关于你母亲和沙地人的事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember what you told me about your mother and the Sand People?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.31,0:15:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,在更多保安机器人来之前，我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we must leave before more security droids arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.74,0:15:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金，没有时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin, there's no time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.41,0:15:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要马上离开这艘船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must get off this ship before it's too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.49,0:15:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他只是晕过去了 - 别管他了，不然我们就赶不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He seems to be all right. - Leave him, or we'll never make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.87,0:15:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会丢下他不管的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His fate will be the same as ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.00,0:15:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,准备攻击！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare for attack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.47,0:15:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,全力开火！开火！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All batteries, fire! Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,电梯失灵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Elevator's not working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.11,0:15:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,R2，激活3224号电梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2, activate elevator 3224.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.47,0:16:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 倒转稳定器 - 倒转稳定器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Reverse stabilizers. - Reversing stabilizers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.99,0:16:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,开动磁场！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Magnetize! Magnetize!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.71,0:16:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,启动紧急助推引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire the emergency booster engines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.05,0:16:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,水平恢复中，长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're levelling out, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.69,0:17:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,放松，我们只是有点小麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy. We're in a bit of a situation here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.99,0:17:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 发生什么了？ - 抓住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did I miss something? - Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么？ - 噢老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is that? - Oops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.99,0:17:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,R2，R2，把电梯停下来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2. R2, shut down the elevator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,太晚了，跳！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too late. Jump!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.64,0:17:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,看看机库里还有没有可以飞的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see if we can find something in the hangar bay that's still flyable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.39,0:17:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,R2，下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2, get down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.23,0:17:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,R2，收到没？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2, do you copy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.52,0:17:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,将军，找到绝地武士了 他们在328号走廊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General, we found the Jedi. They're in hallway 328.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.69,0:17:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,启动射线罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activate ray shields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.99,0:17:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,射线罩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ray shields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.41,0:18:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，怎么会这样？不该发生这种事情的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. How did this happen? We're smarter than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.41,0:18:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,显然不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.75,0:18:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我说耐心些 - 耐心？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I say patience. - Patience?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.80,0:18:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，R2很快就会过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. R2 will be along in a few moments...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.42,0:18:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,然后解除射线罩的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then he'll release the ray shields.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.31,0:18:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,看吧，没问题的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? No problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.90,0:18:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.86,0:18:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,你还有后备方案吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a plan B?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.41,0:18:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.87,0:18:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,谈判代表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The negotiator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.08,0:18:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,肯诺比将军，我们等了你很久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Kenobi. We've been waiting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.42,0:18:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.71,0:18:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这真不像是拯救行动 - 不客气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That wasn't much of a rescue. - You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.22,0:18:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,还有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:18:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金·天行者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.97,0:19:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,名头那么响，没想到你这么年轻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was expecting someone with your reputation to be a little... older.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.19,0:19:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,格菲将军，我也以为你会高一点的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Grievous. You're shorter than I expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.45,0:19:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,绝地垃圾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jedi scum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.16,0:19:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有事要做，阿纳金，别惹他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a job to do, Anakin. Try not to upset him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.75,0:19:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的激光剑会成为我的又一件收藏品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your lightsabres will make a fine addition to my collection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.17,0:19:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不行，而且这次你也别想逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this time. And this time, you won't escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.97,0:19:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,R2\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.97,0:19:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉他们！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crush them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.77,0:19:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,尝尝我们的厉害！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make them suffer!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.86,0:19:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come. Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.65,0:19:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,坚守岗位！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay at your stations!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.49,0:19:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住他！抓住他！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him! Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.14,0:20:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.81,0:20:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别理他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't bother with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.81,0:20:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 保持行驶轨道 - 遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Keep the ship in orbit. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.37,0:20:41.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你输了，肯诺比将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lose, General Kenobi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,快出去！快跑！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here! Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.12,0:21:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候弃船了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to abandon ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.84,0:21:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,所有救生船都发射走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the escape pods have been launched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.34,0:21:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是格菲干的！你开得了这种巡洋舰嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grievous. Can you fly a cruiser like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.51,0:21:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是指我能不能把这堆废铁弄到地面上去吧？ - 嗯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You mean, can I land what's left of it? - Well?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.35,0:21:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,这种情况下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under the circumstances,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.26,0:21:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,飞行技术跟能不能降落都没有关系了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd say the ability to pilot this thing is irrelevant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.31,0:21:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,系好安全带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Strap yourselves in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.27,0:21:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,打开所有舱盖，辅翼，张开缓冲片甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open all hatches. Extend all flaps and drag fins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.13,0:22:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们好象掉了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.13,0:22:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心，我们还有半条船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not to worry. We are still flying half a ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.26,0:22:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我们开太快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now we're really picking up speed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.52,0:22:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,8加60\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight plus 60.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.23,0:22:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们进入大气层了 - 抓着那个，保持水平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're in the atmosphere. - Grab that. Keep us level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.62,0:22:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.13,0:22:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,放轻松，R2\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.68,0:22:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,5000\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}5000.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.43,0:22:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,救火船在左右就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire ships on the left and the right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.47,0:23:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们领你们降落 - 收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We'll take you in. - Copy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.60,0:23:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 跑道就在前面了 - 我们的机身太热了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Landing strip, straight ahead. - We're coming in too hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.85,0:23:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,又一次愉快的着陆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another happy landing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.67,0:24:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你不来吗，师傅？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming, Master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.13,0:24:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我不太想看到那些政客\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm not brave enough for politics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.88,0:24:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我要到长老会去汇报这次的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to report to the council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.76,0:24:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,而且，有人更适合做英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, someone needs to be the poster boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.31,0:24:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，整个行动都是你策划的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on. This whole operation was your idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.27,0:24:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了是你把我从蜂式机器人中救出来的，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us not forget, Anakin, that you rescued me from the buzz droids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.52,0:24:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是你杀了杜库，救了议长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you killed Count Dooku, and you rescued the chancellor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.02,0:24:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,然后把晕倒的我背出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}carrying me unconscious on your back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.69,0:24:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,都是你教我的，师傅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All because of your training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.65,0:24:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金，公平一点，今天，你就是英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin, let's be fair. Today you were the hero...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.28,0:24:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你应当得到政客们的嘉勉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you deserve your glorious day with the politicians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.79,0:24:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧，不过除了这第10次救你之外，你还欠我一份情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. But you owe me one, and not for saving your skin for the 1Oth time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.62,0:24:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是第9次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ninth time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.63,0:24:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,凯特坑道那次不算 例会上见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That business on Cato Neimoidia doesn't count. I'll see you at the briefing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.22,0:24:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,帕尔帕丁议长，你还好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chancellor Palpatine, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.85,0:25:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，多亏了两位绝地武士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Thanks to your two Jedi knights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.85,0:25:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他们杀了杜库伯爵，但是又被格菲将军逃脱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They killed Count Dooku, but General Grievous has escaped once again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.65,0:25:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,格菲向来就只会干这种事，他是个懦夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Grievous will run and hide, as he always does. He's a coward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.28,0:25:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,杜库死后，他就是帝国军的头领了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But with Count Dooku dead, he is the leader of the droid army.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.70,0:25:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以保证地说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I assure you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.70,0:25:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,参议院都会继续支持这场战役\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the senate will vote to continue the war{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.00,0:25:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,只要格菲一天不死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as long as Grievous is alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.54,0:25:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那么绝地长老会也将把寻找格菲作为首要任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the Jedi Council will make finding Grievous our highest priority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.08,0:25:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 当心 - 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watch it. - Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.09,0:25:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 过来，R2 - 共和国真是多亏你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come along, R2. - The Republic cannot praise you enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.17,0:25:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢夸奖，欧甘纳议员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Senator Organa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.34,0:25:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，情况不可能有那么差吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It couldn't possibly be as bad as all that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.72,0:25:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,对，我也同意这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now there I agree with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.72,0:25:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,事实上，我调校一下也可以做到你那样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, I could do with a tune-up myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.56,0:25:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,不过在格菲没死之前，战争还得继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the fighting will continue until General Grievous is spare parts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.81,0:25:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我会尽我所能跟议会进行协调的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will do everything I can in the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.23,0:25:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 失陪一下 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Excuse me. - Certainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.84,0:26:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.09,0:26:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,帕德梅，我想你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've missed you, Padme.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.17,0:26:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,外面有谣言说你死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were whispers that you'd been killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.51,0:26:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是好好的么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.60,0:26:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得我们好象分开了好久好久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It feels like we've been apart for a lifetime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.27,0:26:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,要不是议长被绑架，可能还回不来呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it might have been, if the chancellor hadn't been kidnapped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.18,0:26:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在外围星系打仗的话根本回不来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think they would have ever brought us back from the outer rim sieges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.65,0:26:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等，别在这里 - 就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait. Not here. - Yes, here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.40,0:26:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,对这些伪装我厌倦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm tired of all this deception.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.63,0:26:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我不管他们知不知道我们已经结婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care if they know we're married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.99,0:26:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金，别说这种话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin, don't say things like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.08,0:26:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗？你在发抖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right? You're trembling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.79,0:26:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.01,0:26:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,有一个好消息要告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something wonderful has happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.09,0:26:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的，我怀孕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ani, I'm pregnant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.32,0:27:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,那真是太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.66,0:27:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.08,0:27:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在什么都别担心，好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not gonna worry about anything right now. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.46,0:27:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,现在应该是最快乐的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a happy moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.25,0:27:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我人生中最快乐的时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The happiest moment of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.41,0:28:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,尊贵的西迪陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Lord Sidious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.66,0:28:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,格菲将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Grievous...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.66,0:28:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你先把分裂分子们带到木法星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest you move the separatist leaders to Mustafar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.88,0:28:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好的，陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be done, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.84,0:28:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,将军，战争很快就要结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The end of the war is near, General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.88,0:28:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,但是杜库伯爵的不幸…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the loss of Count Dooku...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.93,0:29:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他的死是必要的损失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His death was a necessary loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.85,0:29:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,很快我就会有一个新的徒弟…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon I will have a new apprentice...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.61,0:29:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他将会更年轻，更强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one far younger and more powerful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.89,0:29:40.89,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的，我想把我们的孩子带回纳布星去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ani, I want to have our baby back home on Naboo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.02,0:29:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以到湖边隐居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can go to the lake country where no one will know...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.48,0:29:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那里很安全的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where we can be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.61,0:29:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以先过去，布置好婴儿房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can go early and fix up the baby's room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.78,0:29:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道在哪里建最好，就在花园旁边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the perfect spot. Right by the gardens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.50,0:30:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的… 很美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are so... beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.42,0:30:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,那是因为我很爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only because I'm so in love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.59,0:30:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.09,0:30:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不，是因为我很爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's because I'm so in love with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.30,0:30:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你的意思是情人眼里出西施？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So love has blinded you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.72,0:30:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不，我不是这个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not exactly what I meant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.35,0:30:26.39,Default,,0,0,0,,但也许是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's probably true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.03,0:30:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金，救我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin, help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.77,0:31:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's bothering you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.77,0:31:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.36,0:31:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我还记得我是什么时候送这个给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember when I gave this to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.32,0:31:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,要多久我们才可以真正坦诚相对？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long is it gonna take for us to be honest with each other?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.79,0:32:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我做了个梦 - 恶梦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was a dream. - Bad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.54,0:32:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,就像那些我母亲死前我做过的梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the ones I used to have about my mother, just before she died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.09,0:32:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这次呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.84,0:32:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这次是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it was about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.43,0:32:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.06,0:32:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,只是个梦而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was only a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.91,0:32:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你因为难产而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You die in childbirth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.70,0:32:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.50,0:32:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.33,0:32:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只是个梦而已    - 我不会让这一切成真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It was only a dream. - I won't let this one become real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.59,0:32:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子会改变我们的一生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This baby will change our lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.59,0:32:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,女王大概不会允许我呆在议会里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I doubt the queen will continue to allow me to serve in the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.68,0:32:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,而长老会如果发现你做了父亲的话，你就会被开除的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the council discovers you're the father, you'll be expelled...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.18,0:33:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.48,0:33:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你说欧比旺可以帮我们吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think Obi-Wan might be able to help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.52,0:33:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不需要他的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't need his help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.32,0:33:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子是对我们的恩赐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our baby is a blessing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.09,0:33:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,前兆？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Premonitions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.67,0:33:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,前兆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Premonitions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.34,0:33:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你见到的这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These visions you have...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.26,0:33:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,是痛苦的，苦难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're of pain, suffering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.48,0:33:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.15,0:33:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是你自己，还是别人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yourself you speak of, or someone you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.49,0:33:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.15,0:33:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,亲密的人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.24,0:33:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.58,0:34:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,当你感知未来的时候，要小心，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful you must be when sensing the future, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.54,0:34:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对失去的恐惧将带你走进黑暗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fear of loss is a path to the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.09,0:34:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我不可以让这些发生的，尤达长老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't let these visions come true, Master Yoda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.47,0:34:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,死亡是生命中自然的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death is a natural part of life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.76,0:34:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,当你身边的人转化为原力时，你应该感到欣喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rejoice for those around you who transform into the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.56,0:34:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不要忧伤，不要想念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mourn them, do not. Miss them, do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.94,0:34:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,依恋将导致嫉妒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attachment leads to jealousy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.15,0:34:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那就是贪婪的影子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The shadow of greed that is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.69,0:34:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,尤达长老，我该怎么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What must I do, Master Yoda?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.61,0:34:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,训练你自己去放开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Train yourself to let go...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.78,0:34:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,那些你害怕失去的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of everything you fear to lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.92,0:34:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你没听到外围战况的报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've missed the report on the outer rim sieges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.80,0:34:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思，我有点事耽搁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I was held up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.30,0:35:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是我的错 - 总言而之，战事非常顺利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I have no excuse. - In short, they are going very well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.31,0:35:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,贸易联盟的势力大不如前，沃斯大师把他的军队移到了博兹佩提\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saleucami has fallen, and Master Vos has moved his troops to Boz Pity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.61,0:35:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,有什么问题？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.98,0:35:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,今天参议院要进行投票以决定是否给议长更多的权力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The senate is expected to vote more executive powers to the chancellor today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.91,0:35:18.23,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，那就说明以后要少说话，多做事了，不好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That can only mean less deliberating and more action. Is that bad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.37,0:35:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那样我们结束战争就更容易了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll make it easier for us to end this war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.54,0:35:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,提防你的朋友帕尔帕丁议长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful of your friend Palpatine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.50,0:35:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,提防他什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful of what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.50,0:35:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他指明要你出席 - 为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He has requested your presence. - What for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.26,0:35:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,他没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would not say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.55,0:35:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他没有先通知长老会？很不寻常，是不是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't inform the council? That's unusual, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.22,0:35:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切都很不寻常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of this is unusual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.56,0:35:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,所以才让我感到不安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's making me feel uneasy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.99,0:35:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望你相信我，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope you trust me, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.91,0:36:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.29,0:36:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子，我需要你的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your help, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.33,0:36:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.13,0:36:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我全靠你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm depending on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.71,0:36:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？我不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what? I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.76,0:36:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,去做共和国的眼睛、耳朵和声音吧…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be the eyes, ears and voice of the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.45,0:36:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.68,0:36:24.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我将指定你做我在长老会上的私人代表\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm appointing you to be my personal representative on the Jedi Council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.94,0:36:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.98,0:36:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,当长老？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.82,0:36:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我担当不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm overwhelmed, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.61,0:36:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,长老会是自行选择成员的，他们不会接受的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But the council elects its own members. They'll never accept this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.83,0:36:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我想他们会的 他们需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think they will. They need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.25,0:36:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,比你所想象的更需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More than you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.55,0:36:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,长老会是不会轻易承认这种指派的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Allow this appointment lightly the council does not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.43,0:37:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,令人不解的是，提出这种要求的是帕尔帕丁议长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disturbing is this move by Chancellor Palpatine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.06,0:37:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.73,0:37:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你是长老会的成员…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are on this council...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.19,0:37:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但是我们不会给你长老头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but we do not grant you the rank of master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.86,0:37:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.49,0:37:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你们怎么可以这样？我无法忍受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you do this? This is outrageous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.50,0:37:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这不公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's unfair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.04,0:37:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,既是成员，怎么可以没有头衔呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you be on the council and not be a master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.05,0:37:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下说，年轻的天行者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a seat, young Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.97,0:37:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,失敬了，大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.81,0:37:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经检查过共和国内的所有星系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have surveyed all systems in the Republic...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.35,0:37:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但是找不到格菲的踪影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but have found no sign of General Grievous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.19,0:37:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他一定躲在外围星系里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiding in the outer rim Grievous is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.07,0:37:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你们也要检查一下边远的星系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The outlying systems you must sweep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.28,0:37:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的船不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do not have many ships to spare.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.61,0:37:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,另外帝国军攻打乌其人的事情怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the droid attack on the Wookiees?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.87,0:38:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须马上派出援军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is critical we send an attack group there immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.70,0:38:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对，我们不能再失去一个星系了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right. It's a system we cannot afford to lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.46,0:38:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我会去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.67,0:38:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟乌其人的关系很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good relations with the Wookiees I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.80,0:38:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那就这么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's settled then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.51,0:38:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,尤达将带一队克隆兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yoda will take a battalion of clones{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.01,0:38:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,到卡西克支援乌其人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to reinforce the Wookiees on Kashyyyk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.64,0:38:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,愿原力与我们同在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May the Force be with us all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.93,0:38:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这算什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of nonsense is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.69,0:38:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,让我加入长老会，却不给我长老头衔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put me on the council and not make me a master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.19,0:38:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,绝地武士的历史上从来没有过，这是一种羞辱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's never been done in the history of the Jedi. It's insulting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.07,0:38:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静点，阿纳金，你已经很受重用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm down, Anakin. You have been given a great honour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.03,0:38:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,在你这个年龄就得以加入长老会，这从来都没有过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be on the council at your age... it's never happened before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.16,0:38:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,事实是你跟议长关系太密切了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fact of the matter is you are too close to the chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.66,0:38:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,长老会并不喜欢他过多的干涉绝地武士的事务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The council doesn't like it when he interferes in Jedi affairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.54,0:38:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我对你发誓，我没有要求过进入长老会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear to you, I didn't ask to be put on the council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.05,0:38:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,但你心里是这么想的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's what you wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.38,0:38:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟议长的交情看来有回报了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friendship with Chancellor Palpatine seems to have paid off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.80,0:38:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那跟这没有关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That has nothing to do with this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.80,0:38:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,长老会批准任命你的唯一理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only reason the council has approved your appointment...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.85,0:39:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,就是议长对你的信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is because the chancellor trusts you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.93,0:39:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,还有呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.89,0:39:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金，我是站在你这边的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin, I am on your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.48,0:39:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想你陷入这样的状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want to put you in this situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.19,0:39:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,什么状况？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What situation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.45,0:39:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,长老会希望你可以报告议长的一举一动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The council wants you to report on all the chancellor's dealings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.91,0:39:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想知道他到底想做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want to know what he's up to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.79,0:39:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他们想让我去监视议长？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want me to spy on the chancellor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.71,0:39:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是叛国！ - 我们在战争中，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But that's treason. - We are at war, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.42,0:39:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么会议上长老会不直接指派我这项任务？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't the council give me this assignment when we were in session?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.47,0:39:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这项任务是不作记录的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This assignment is not to be on record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.01,0:39:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,议长并没有那么坏，欧比王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chancellor is not a bad man, Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.06,0:39:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他对我很好，从我第一次来就很关照我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He befriended me. He's watched out for me ever since I arrived here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.19,0:39:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你必须帮助我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is why you must help us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.40,0:39:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金，我们效忠的是参议院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin, our allegiance is to the senate, not to its leader...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.98,0:39:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,而不是一个任期已满却不肯下台的领导者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who has managed to stay in office long after his term has expired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.78,0:39:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是参议院让他连任的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The senate demanded that he stay longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.87,0:39:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，但是你仔细想想，阿纳金，这样是不是不太合适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, but use your feelings, Anakin. Something is out of place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.41,0:40:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你叫我做的事情违背了绝地武士的原则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're asking me to do something against the Jedi code.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.29,0:40:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,违背了共和国，违背了一位良师和知己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Against the Republic. Against a mentor and a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.46,0:40:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,这些才是不合适的，为什么叫我做这件事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what's out of place here. Why are you asking this of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.76,0:40:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,是长老会要你做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The council is asking you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.60,0:40:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金似乎对他的新任务不太热衷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin did not take to his new assignment with much enthusiasm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.48,0:40:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他们两个在一起实在太危险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very dangerous, putting them together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.78,0:40:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得这孩子肯定处理不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think the boy can handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.20,0:40:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我信不过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't trust him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.82,0:40:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,长老，冒昧地问一下，难道他不是预言中的那个人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all due respect, Master, is he not the chosen one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.79,0:40:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,难道不该是他来毁灭西斯，恢复原力的平衡吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he not to destroy the Sith and bring balance to the Force?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.25,0:40:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,预言是这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the prophecy says.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.54,0:40:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,预言也可能误导了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A prophecy that misread could have been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.26,0:40:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会让我失望的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will not let me down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.26,0:40:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,从来都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He never has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.30,0:41:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope right you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.38,0:41:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,有时我在想，绝地武士的原则到底怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I wonder what's happening to the Jedi order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.13,0:41:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我认为战争正在破坏着共和国的法则\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think this war is destroying the principles of the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.05,0:41:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有想过也许我们都站错边了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you ever considered that we may be on the wrong side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.35,0:41:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.93,0:41:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,会不会我们一直信奉着的民主政治已经不复存在？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if the democracy we thought we were serving no longer exists...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.65,0:41:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,共和国是不是已经沦为了我们致力消灭的邪恶组织？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the Republic has become the very evil we've been fighting to destroy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.07,0:41:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我不相信 你怎么听起来像分裂分子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe that. And you're sounding like a separatist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.57,0:41:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,这场战争代表了开明政治的失败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This war represents a failure to listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.62,0:41:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,现在，你是议长最亲近的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're closer to the chancellor than anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.74,0:42:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,求你叫他停止战争，恢复民主吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, ask him to stop the fighting and let diplomacy resume.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.12,0:42:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,别跟我说这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ask me to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.25,0:42:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事情要去跟参议院说，我可管不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make a motion in the senate, where that kind of a request belongs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.76,0:42:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？ - 没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is it? - Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.14,0:42:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样，别把我也关在心门之外，让我帮助你好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do this. Don't shut me out. Let me help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.77,0:42:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,抱着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.35,0:42:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,就像在纳布的湖边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you did by the lake on Naboo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.77,0:42:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,就像以前，我们之间只有爱情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So long ago, when there was nothing but our love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.65,0:42:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没有政治，没有算计，没有战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No politics, no plotting, no war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.32,0:43:15.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你有事找我，议长？ - 对，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You wanted to see me, Chancellor. - Yes, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.12,0:43:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,过来 我有好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come closer. I have good news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.79,0:43:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的克隆人情报机关…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our clone intelligence units...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.79,0:43:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,已经找到格菲将军的行踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have discovered the location of General Grievous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.96,0:43:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他躲在尤塔帕星系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's hiding in the Utapau system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.67,0:43:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可找到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.26,0:43:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,终于可以抓到这个大魔头结束战争了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll be able to capture that monster and end this war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.55,0:43:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,如果长老会不派你参与此项任务的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would worry about the collective wisdom of the council...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.01,0:43:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我将对他们的集体智慧产生怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if it didn't select you for this assignment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.52,0:43:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,目前为止，你是最佳的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the best choice, by far.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.90,0:43:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.48,0:43:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你们退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.78,0:44:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.25,0:44:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我不能依赖于绝地长老会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I'm not able to rely on the Jedi Council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.50,0:44:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他们还没把你纳入计划，他们很快也会和你说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they haven't included you in their plot, they soon will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.80,0:44:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我不太明白您的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.01,0:44:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你应该感觉得到我的疑虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must sense what I have come to suspect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.81,0:44:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,绝地长老会想完全控制共和国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Jedi Council want control of the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.56,0:44:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他们计划背叛我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're planning to betray me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.19,0:44:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我想不是吧… - 阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't think that... - Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.78,0:44:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你好好感觉一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Search your feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.91,0:44:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的，不是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.87,0:44:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他们不信任你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know they don't trust you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.87,0:44:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,或者是参议院 或是共和国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or the senate. Or the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.29,0:44:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,或是民主，就此而言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or democracy, for that matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.67,0:44:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须承认，我对他们的信任已经动摇了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to admit, my trust in them has been shaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.14,0:44:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.81,0:45:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是他们让你做一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They asked you to do something that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.93,0:45:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,有悖你良心的事情？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}made you feel dishonest, didn't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.11,0:45:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他们让你监视我，是不是？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They asked you to spy on me, didn't they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.02,0:45:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.12,0:45:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该说些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.12,0:45:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,还记得以前的教诲吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember back to your early teachings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.29,0:45:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,“所有获得权力的人都会害怕失去权力”\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All who gain power are afraid to lose it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.21,0:45:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- 绝地武士也是如此 - 绝地武士是用他们的力量行善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Even the Jedi. - The Jedi use their power for good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.96,0:45:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,所谓的“善”不过是相对而言，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good is a point of view, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.22,0:45:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,西斯和绝地武士在几乎所有方面都相似\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Sith and the Jedi are similar in almost every way...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.43,0:45:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,包括对更强力量的追求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including their quest for greater power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.73,0:45:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,西斯依赖内心的激情去获取力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Sith rely on their passion for their strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.86,0:45:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只在乎自身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They think inwards... only about themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.82,0:45:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,难道绝地武士不是这样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the Jedi don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.95,0:45:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,绝地武士很无私，他们只关心他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Jedi are selfless. They only care about others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.92,0:46:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你听说过西斯黑暗君主，达斯·普雷厄斯的悲剧吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you ever hear the tragedy of Darth Plagueis the Wise?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.00,0:46:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.01,0:46:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我想也是 绝地武士是不会把这故事告诉你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought not. It's not a story the Jedi would tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.52,0:46:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个西斯的传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Sith legend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.44,0:46:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,达斯·普雷厄斯曾是西斯的一位黑暗君主…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darth Plagueis was a dark lord of the Sith...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.74,0:46:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,非常强大而且充满智慧…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so powerful and so wise...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.74,0:46:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他甚至可以使用原力影响迷地原虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he could use the Force to influence the midi-chlorians...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.70,0:46:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,来创造生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to create... life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.54,0:46:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他对黑暗原力如此的了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had such a knowledge of the dark side...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.71,0:46:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,使他可以让自己关心的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he could even keep the ones he cared about...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.30,0:46:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,起死回生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.06,0:47:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他真的可以…让人起死回生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He could actually... save people from death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.73,0:47:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,原力黑暗的一面可以通往许多奇异能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dark side of the Force is a pathway to many abilities...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.36,0:47:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,有些被认为是非自然的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some consider to be unnatural.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.66,0:47:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,他后来怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.57,0:47:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他变得非常强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He became so powerful...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.00,0:47:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他在这世上只害怕一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the only thing he was afraid of was...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.29,0:47:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,就是失去他的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}losing his power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.29,0:47:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,但最终他还是失去了力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which eventually, of course, he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.63,0:47:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他把所有的知识传授给了他的徒弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, he taught his apprentice everything he knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.59,0:47:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,因此他徒弟就趁他睡觉时将他杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then his apprentice killed him in his sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.43,0:47:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,真是讽刺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's ironic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.31,0:47:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,他可以让别人起死回生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He could save others from death...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.56,0:47:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但却无法救他自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.82,0:47:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能学到这种力量吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it possible to learn this power?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.20,0:48:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,从绝地武士那里可学不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not from a Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.22,0:48:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,红队到这边集合！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All Red units, over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.90,0:48:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,帕尔帕丁认为格菲将军在尤塔帕星球？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Palpatine thinks General Grievous is on Utapau?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.11,0:48:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,截获了只言片语…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A partial message was intercepted...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.12,0:48:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,从尤塔帕星首领发出的一份外交信息中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a diplomatic packet from the chairman of Utapau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.16,0:48:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须行动起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Act on this we must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.50,0:48:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住格菲将军就可以结束这场战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The capture of General Grievous will end this war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.21,0:48:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须速战速决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quickly and decisively we should proceed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.93,0:48:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,议长要求由我来领导这次战役\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chancellor has requested... that I lead the campaign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.93,0:49:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,这事由绝地长老会决定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The council will make up its own mind who is to go...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.68,0:49:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,议长无权干涉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not the chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.77,0:49:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要一位经验丰富的长老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A master is needed, with more experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.82,0:49:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我推举，由肯诺比长老领衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I concur. Master Kenobi should go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.40,0:49:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.95,0:49:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.20,0:49:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.87,0:49:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,很好，会议结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well. Council adjourned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.71,0:49:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,机器人部队已经启动了主发电机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The droids have started up their main power generators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.21,0:49:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是时候开战了，指挥官 - 是的，长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then now the time is, Commander. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.65,0:49:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.25,0:50:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,注意掩护！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head for cover!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.60,0:50:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这次你需要我的帮助   - 我同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're gonna need me on this one. - I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.60,0:50:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不过，搞不好这次会变成一场班沙星的追逐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, it may turn out just to be a wild bantha chase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.57,0:50:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,师父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.61,0:50:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你失望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've disappointed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.28,0:50:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不是很感激你对我的栽培之恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't been very appreciative of your training.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.07,0:50:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直都自以为是，我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been arrogant, and I apologize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.58,0:50:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我对绝地长老会感到非常失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've just been so frustrated with the council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.25,0:50:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你既强大又聪明，阿纳金，我以你为荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are strong and wise, Anakin, and I am very proud of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.09,0:50:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我从小就开始训练你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have trained you since you were a small boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.80,0:50:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我所知道的一切都已经教给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have taught you everything I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.01,0:50:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经成为一名真正的绝地武士，甚至超出了我的期望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you have become a far greater Jedi than I could ever hope to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.64,0:51:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但是耐心点，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But be patient, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.44,0:51:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,绝地长老会很快就会让你成为长老的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will not be long before the council makes you a Jedi master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.99,0:51:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,欧比旺，愿原力与你同在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obi-Wan. May the Force be with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.37,0:51:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,再见，老朋友，愿原力与你同在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, old friend. May the Force be with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.85,0:51:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,幸运的是，大部分城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fortunately, most of the cities are{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.12,0:51:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,都集中在这一小块大陆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}concentrated on this small continent here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.52,0:51:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,在远端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the far side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.27,0:51:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我会吸引他们的注意力，直到你们到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll keep them distracted until you get there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.69,0:51:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,只要别太久就行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just don't take too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.40,0:51:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,得了，我何时让你失望过？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. When have I ever let you down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.53,0:51:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,非常好，我身上的累赘就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well. The burden is on me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.59,0:52:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,在你们到来之前不会干掉所有的机器人士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not to destroy all the droids until you arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.11,0:52:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,节省点力气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save your energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.57,0:52:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.44,0:52:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不要放弃，帕德美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't give up, Padm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.67,0:52:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,欧比旺来过，对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obi-Wan's been here, hasn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.25,0:52:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他今早来过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He came by this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.72,0:52:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他想要干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.72,0:52:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,他很担心你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's worried about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.14,0:53:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你最近承受着很大的压力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He says you've been under a lot of stress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.27,0:53:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉自己迷失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.11,0:53:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,迷失了？什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lost? What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.15,0:53:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,欧比旺和绝地长老会不信任我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obi-Wan and the council don't trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.61,0:53:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他们用自己的生命来信任你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They trust you with their lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.79,0:53:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,发生了一些事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.41,0:53:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我并不是一个称职的绝地武士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not the Jedi I should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.96,0:53:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我想要更多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.13,0:53:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,但我知道自己不应该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I know I shouldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.13,0:53:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你对自己期望过多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You expect too much of yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.10,0:53:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我找到了救你的方法 - 救我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I found a way to save you. - Save me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.39,0:53:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,从我的梦魇中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From my nightmares.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.44,0:53:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,是这事一直困扰着你吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what's bothering you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.40,0:53:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会失去你的，帕德美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't lose you, Padm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.15,0:53:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会难产而死的，亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna die in childbirth, Ani.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.36,0:53:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我向你保证 - 不，我向你保证！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I promise you. - No, I promise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.74,0:54:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你好，年轻的绝地武士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greetings, young Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.25,0:54:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么来到我们这颗遥远的避难行星？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What brings you to our remote sanctuary?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.79,0:54:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,很不幸，是因为战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.50,0:54:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没有战争，除非你带来了战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no war here... unless you brought it with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.51,0:54:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你允许的话，我想补充点燃料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With your kind permission, I should like some fuel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.80,0:54:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,同时借用你的城市作为基地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and to use your city as a base{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.70,0:54:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,在附近行星搜寻格菲将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as I search nearby systems for General Grievous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.73,0:55:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他就在这里，我们全是人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is here. We are being held hostage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.11,0:55:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他们正在监视着我们 - 我明白了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They are watching us. - I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.11,0:55:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在第十层，有成千上万的战斗机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tenth level, thousands of battle droids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.04,0:55:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,让你的人民做好避难准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell your people to take shelter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.58,0:55:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你有士兵，现在是派上用场的时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you have warriors, now is the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.47,0:55:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,把战斗机开回母舰去，告诉科迪，我已经联系好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take the fighter back to the ship. Tell Cody I've made contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.64,0:55:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他会带更多的士兵来吗？ - 他没说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is he bringing additional warriors? - He didn't say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.07,0:56:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,共和国的军队很快就会追踪到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't be long before the armies of the Republic track us here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.91,0:56:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你到外围星系的木塔法星去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sending you to the Mustafar system in the outer rim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.63,0:56:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那是一个多火山的星球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a volcanic planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.05,0:56:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在那里你会安全的 - 安全？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You will be safe there. - Safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.18,0:56:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,将军，你让帕尔帕丁议长从你手上溜掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chancellor Palpatine managed to escape your grip, General.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.56,0:57:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,没有了杜库伯爵，我怀疑你是否还有能力保障我们的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Without Count Dooku, I have doubts about your ability to keep us safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.90,0:57:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,说谢谢吧，总督，你得庆幸没有落到我的手上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be thankful, Viceroy, you have not found yourself in my grip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.53,0:57:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的飞船准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your ship is waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.05,0:57:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,大家好！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.97,0:57:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,肯诺比将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Kenobi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.64,0:57:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是有勇无谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a bold one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.23,0:57:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.54,0:58:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.08,0:58:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲自来对付这个绝地废物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will deal with this Jedi slime myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.80,0:58:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你出招吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.09,0:58:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你这傻瓜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.93,0:58:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,杜库伯爵曾教过我你们绝地武士的剑术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been trained in your Jedi arts by Count Dooku.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.27,0:58:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,出招吧，肯诺比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attack, Kenobi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.11,0:59:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,不管你有没有军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Army or not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.52,0:59:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你得知道自己已经大难临头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you must realize you are doomed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.74,0:59:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不这样想！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.13,1:00:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,掩护那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cover that corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.93,1:01:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,云度大师，我可以打断一下吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Windu, may I interrupt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.10,1:01:06.86,Default,,0,0,0,,肯诺比将军已和格菲将军交上手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}General Kenobi has made contact with General Grievous...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.98,1:01:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经开始进攻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we have begun our attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.36,1:01:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你，指挥官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Commander.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.19,1:01:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金，把这报告转呈议长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin, deliver this report to the chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.41,1:01:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他的反应会暴露他的意图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His reaction will give us a clue to his intentions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.78,1:01:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，大师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.71,1:01:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我感觉有人在密谋毁灭绝地武士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sense a plot to destroy the Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.09,1:01:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗原力笼罩着议长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dark side of the Force surrounds the chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.26,1:01:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,如果他不愿放弃他的紧急权力…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he does not give up his emergency powers...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.59,1:01:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,在格菲被歼灭后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after the destruction of Grievous...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.60,1:01:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那他应该被逐出政府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then he should be removed from office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.31,1:01:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,绝地长老会应该接管参议院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Jedi Council would have to take control of the senate...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.94,1:01:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,以便权力能安全和平地移交\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in order to secure a peaceful transition.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.94,1:01:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这想法会将我们带入绝境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To a dark place this line of thought will carry us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.65,1:01:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须得小心行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great care we must take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.21,1:02:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,议长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.46,1:02:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚收到肯诺比大师发来的报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've just received a report from Master Kenobi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.09,1:02:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他已和格菲将军交战了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has engaged General Grievous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.84,1:02:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能希望肯诺比大师能够应付这次挑战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can only hope that Master Kenobi is up to the challenge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.05,1:02:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该到那里和他并肩战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should be there with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.14,1:02:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,看起来绝地长老会并不完全认同你的才能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's upsetting to me to see that the council...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.60,1:02:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这让我很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}doesn't seem to fully appreciate your talents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.98,1:02:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你难道不想知道他们为何不让你成为绝地长老吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you wonder why they won't make you a Jedi master?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.77,1:02:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望自己知道原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wish I knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.07,1:02:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我越来越觉得自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More and more I get the feeling that...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.70,1:02:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,被排斥在绝地长老会之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm being excluded from the council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.92,1:02:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他们没有把有些关于原力的知识告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know there are things about the Force that they're not telling me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.09,1:02:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不信任你，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't trust you, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.26,1:02:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们看到了你的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They see your future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.39,1:02:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,他们知道你的力量会超越他们的控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They know your power will be too strong to control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.43,1:03:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须看穿这些谎言迷雾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must break through the fog of lies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.95,1:03:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,绝地武士散布在你周围的的谎言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Jedi have created around you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.52,1:03:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,让我帮助你了解原力的奥妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me help you to know the subtleties of the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.40,1:03:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道使用原力的方法？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know the ways of the Force?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.57,1:03:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我师父教会了我所有关于原力的知识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mentor taught me everything about the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.41,1:03:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,甚至包括黑暗原力的本质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even the nature of the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.37,1:03:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你了解黑暗原力？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the dark side?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.74,1:03:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.34,1:03:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,如果一个人想要通晓原力的奥妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If one is to understand the great mystery...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.76,1:03:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,就必须研究其方方面面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one must study all its aspects...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.26,1:03:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,而不仅仅是绝地武士那些狭隘的教条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not just the dogmatic narrow view of the Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.14,1:03:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你想成为一位睿智、十足的领袖人物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you wish to become a complete and wise leader...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.39,1:03:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须更多的去了解原力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you must embrace a larger view of the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.81,1:03:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,小心那些绝地武士，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful of the Jedi, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.86,1:03:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,只有通过我你才能获得比绝地武士更强大的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only through me can you achieve a power greater than any Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.78,1:03:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,学会了使用黑暗原力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Learn to know the dark side of the Force...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.54,1:04:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你就可以把你的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you will be able to save your wife...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.29,1:04:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,从死亡的命运中解救出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from certain death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.46,1:04:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.46,1:04:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,希望你能运用我的知识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use my knowledge. I beg you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.80,1:04:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你是西斯君主！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the Sith lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.09,1:04:18.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道是什么困扰着你，听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what's been troubling you. Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.93,1:04:23.60,Default,,0,0,0,,别再继续当绝地长老会手中的小卒子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't continue to be a pawn of the Jedi Council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.77,1:04:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,从我认识你起，你就在追寻一种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever since I've known you, you've been searching for a life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.32,1:04:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,比寻常绝地武士更为伟大的人生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}greater than that of an ordinary Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.99,1:04:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,一种具有重要意义的人生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A life of significance...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.49,1:04:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,一种道德的人生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of conscience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.00,1:04:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想要杀我吗？    - 我当然会这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you going to kill me? - I would certainly like to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.33,1:04:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.84,1:04:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我能感受到你的愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can feel your anger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.76,1:04:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,它使你全神贯注\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It gives you focus...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.55,1:04:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,使你更加强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}makes you stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.19,1:05:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我要把你交给绝地长老会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to turn you over to the Jedi Council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.65,1:05:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,当然你该这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. You should.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.40,1:05:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,但是你并不清楚他们的目的，对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're not sure of their intentions, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.53,1:05:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我很快就会发现这一切的真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will quickly discover the truth of all this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.20,1:05:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你很聪明，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have great wisdom, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.70,1:05:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,来了解黑暗原力吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Know the power of the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.45,1:05:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一种可以拯救帕德美的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power to save Padm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.76,1:07:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真原始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So uncivilized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.43,1:07:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,云度大师，我得和你谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Windu, I must talk to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.56,1:07:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,天行者，我们刚得知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skywalker, we just received word that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.45,1:07:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,欧比旺消灭了格菲将军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obi-Wan has destroyed General Grievous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.48,1:07:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们去确保…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on our way to make sure...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.48,1:07:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,议长将紧急特权交还参议院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the chancellor returns emergency power back to the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.86,1:07:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会放弃他的权力，我刚得知一个可怕的事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He won't give up his power. I've just learned a terrible truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.62,1:07:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我想帕尔帕丁议长就是西斯君主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think Chancellor Palpatine is a Sith lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.20,1:08:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,西斯君主？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Sith lord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.87,1:08:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，就是我们一直在寻找的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. The one we've been looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.83,1:08:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么会知道这事？ - 他懂得原力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How do you know this? - He knows the ways of the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.88,1:08:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他受过使用黑暗原力的训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been trained to use the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.13,1:08:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你确信？ - 完全确信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you sure? - Absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.38,1:08:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们最害怕的事就成真了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then our worst fears have been realized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.72,1:08:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,为了绝地武士团的生死存亡，我们得赶快行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must move quickly if the Jedi order is to survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.31,1:08:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,长老，议长非常强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master, the chancellor is very powerful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.85,1:08:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你要去逮捕他，你需要我的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll need my help if you're going to arrest him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.23,1:08:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是不要插手此事为好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you own good, stay out of this affair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.27,1:08:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我能感觉到你内心的迷惑，年轻的天行者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sense a great deal of confusion in you, young Skywalker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.15,1:08:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,恐惧蒙蔽了你的判断力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is much fear that clouds your judgement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.40,1:08:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 长老，我必须去 - 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I must go, Master. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.58,1:08:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你所言属实，你就会得到我的信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If what you've told me is true, you will have gained my trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.66,1:08:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在，留在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But for now, remain here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.42,1:08:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,在绝地长老会议事厅等我们回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait in the council chambers until we return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.51,1:08:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，长老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.87,1:09:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道的，对吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do know, don't you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.25,1:09:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,如果绝地武士杀掉了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if theJedi destroy me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.71,1:09:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你就无望拯救她的生命了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}any chance of saving her will be lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.60,1:11:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,云度长老，我猜格菲将军已被歼灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Windu. I take it General Grievous has been destroyed then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.98,1:11:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你们比我想的干得还要快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must say you're here sooner than expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.52,1:11:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,以银河共和国参议院的名义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the name of the Galactic Senate of the Republic...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.24,1:11:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你被逮了，议长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're under arrest, Chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.28,1:11:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你在威胁我吗，长老？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you threatening me, Master Jedi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.99,1:11:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,参议院将决定你的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The senate will decide your fate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.03,1:11:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我就是参议院  - 还不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I am the senate. - Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.21,1:11:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那这就是叛变行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's treason then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.52,1:13:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你被捕了，君主殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are under arrest, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.20,1:13:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金，我告诉过你他们会这样做 我说对了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin, I told you it would come to this. I was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.62,1:13:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,绝地武士想要篡权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Jedi are taking over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.87,1:13:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,西斯横行的时代过去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The oppression of the Sith will never return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.46,1:13:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经输了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.70,1:13:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.27,1:13:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不！才不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.55,1:13:30.45,Default,,0,0,0,,要死的是你们！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.22,1:13:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个叛徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a traitor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.22,1:13:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他才是叛徒！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is the traitor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.56,1:13:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我有能力拯救你爱的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have the power to save the one you love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.73,1:13:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须作出选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must choose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.73,1:13:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,别听他的，阿纳金！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't listen to him, Anakin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.40,1:13:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,别让他杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let him kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.16,1:14:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我坚持不住了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't hold it any longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.21,1:14:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我不行了 我很虚弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't. I'm weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.42,1:14:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,太虚弱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm too weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.40,1:14:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.05,1:14:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,救救我！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me. Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.01,1:14:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我坚持不下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't hold on any longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.30,1:14:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在就能解决你，一劳永逸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am going to end this once and for all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.02,1:14:22.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.60,1:14:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他必须接受审判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must stand trial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.61,1:14:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经控制了参议院和法院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has control of the senate and the courts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.15,1:14:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他太危险了，必须除掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's too dangerous to be left alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.49,1:14:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我太虚弱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm too weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.86,1:14:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- 求你饶我一命 - 这不是绝地武士的处事方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't kill me. Please. - It's not the Jedi way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.57,1:14:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他必须活下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.20,1:14:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 请别杀他 - 我需要他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please don't. - I need him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.79,1:14:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别这样！ - 不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please don't! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.30,1:14:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,力量！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.48,1:15:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,无尽的原力！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlimited power!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.28,1:15:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我干了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have I done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.63,1:15:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你在履践自己的命运，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're fulfilling your destiny, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.76,1:15:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,成为我的徒弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Become my apprentice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.59,1:15:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,研习黑暗原力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Learn to use the dark side of the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.69,1:15:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我听从你的吩咐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will do whatever you ask.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.86,1:15:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.99,1:15:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,只要你能助我拯救帕德美的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just help me save Padm?s life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.53,1:15:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,没有她我也不能独活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't live without her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.08,1:16:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,古往今来只有一人曾习得起死回生之术…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To cheat death is a power only one has achieved...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.59,1:16:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,但如果我们一起研习…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but if we work together...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.67,1:16:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我肯定我们能洞悉其奥秘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know we can discover the secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.14,1:16:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓忠于…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pledge myself...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.85,1:16:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,您的教诲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to your teachings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.98,1:16:25.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.90,1:16:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.95,1:16:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你的原力很强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Force is strong with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.50,1:16:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你将会成一个无比强大的西斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A powerful Sith you will become.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.17,1:16:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,从今以后，你将被认为是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Henceforth you shall be known as...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.55,1:16:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,达斯… 维德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darth... Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.39,1:17:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢您，我的恩师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, my master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.61,1:17:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,免礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.54,1:17:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我年轻的徒弟，因为绝地长老会不信任你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the council did not trust you, my young apprentice...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.25,1:17:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我相信你是唯一对他们的阴谋毫不知情的绝地武士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe you are the only Jedi with no knowledge of this plot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.34,1:17:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,如果那些绝地武士知道了他们的阴谋已经败露\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the Jedi learn what has transpired here...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.18,1:17:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会杀掉我们，连同所有的参议员一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they will kill us, along with all the senators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.98,1:17:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.06,1:17:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,绝地长老会下一步就会推翻参议院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The council's next move will be against the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.06,1:17:49.73,Default,,0,0,0,,每一名绝地武士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every single Jedi...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.86,1:17:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,包括你的好友欧比旺·肯诺比…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including your friend Obi-Wan Kenobi...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.24,1:17:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,现在都是共和国的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is now an enemy of the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.83,1:17:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我明白，师父\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.58,1:18:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得赶快行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must move quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.62,1:18:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这些绝地武士冷酷无情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Jedi are relentless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.67,1:18:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不将他们赶尽杀绝，恐怕这场内战永无止息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they are not all destroyed, it will be civil war without end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.17,1:18:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,首先，我要你去绝地圣殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First I want you to go to the Jedi temple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.05,1:18:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要攻他们一个措手不及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will catch them off-balance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.31,1:18:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,去做该做的事吧，维德勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what must be done, Lord Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.31,1:18:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不要犹豫不决，不要心慈手软\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not hesitate. Show no mercy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.40,1:18:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,只有那样你才会有足够强大的黑暗原力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only then will you be strong enough with the dark side...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.28,1:18:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,以拯救帕德美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to save Padm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.41,1:18:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那其他分散在星系间的绝地武士怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the other Jedi spread across the galaxy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.37,1:18:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的背叛行为会得到处置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their betrayal will be dealt with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.38,1:18:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,在你干掉圣殿里的绝地武士后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After you have killed all the Jedi in the temple...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.75,1:18:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,赶往木塔法星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}go to the Mustafar system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.55,1:18:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,杀掉刚雷总督\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wipe out Viceroy Gunray...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.93,1:18:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,和其他分裂分子的首领\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the other separatist leaders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.47,1:19:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,西斯将再一次一统整个星系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once more the Sith will rule the galaxy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.61,1:19:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,同时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.44,1:19:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将会得到和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we shall have... peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.74,1:19:57.61,Default,,0,0,0,,军士，过来！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant, over here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.66,1:20:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,快跟上！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry! All of them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.37,1:20:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,红色单位，干掉它！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All Red units, let's move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.38,1:20:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,过来，出发！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.14,1:20:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,指挥官，联系你的部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander, contact your troops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.27,1:20:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,叫他们去占领高层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them to move to the higher levels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.31,1:20:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.32,1:20:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,对了，我想您会需要这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, I think you'll be needing this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.28,1:20:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你，科迪，快行动，我们得尽快赢下这场战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Cody. Let's get a move on. We've got a battle to win.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.95,1:20:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.91,1:20:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,科迪指挥官…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commander Cody...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.08,1:20:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,时机成熟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the time has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.50,1:20:51.75,Default,,0,0,0,,执行66号令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Execute order 66.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.51,1:20:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.31,1:20:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,轰掉他！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blast him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.63,1:21:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,来啊！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.43,1:22:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,执行66号令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Execute order 66.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.73,1:22:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命，陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be done, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.19,1:23:09.15,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命，陛下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will be done, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.02,1:23:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,天行者大师，敌人太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Skywalker, there are too many of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.52,1:23:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are we going to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.00,1:24:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,从议长办公室传来的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chancellor's office indicated{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.06,1:24:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,说阿纳金主人回绝地圣殿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Anakin returned to the Jedi temple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.25,1:24:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,别太担心，夫人，我肯定他不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. I'm sure he'll be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.58,1:24:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是怎么了？ - 发生了叛乱，阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's going on here? - There's been a rebellion, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.75,1:24:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,别担心，局势已在我们的控制之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry. The situation is under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.12,1:24:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起，阁下，您该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, sir. It's time for you to leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.42,1:24:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,的确如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.51,1:24:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,干掉他！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.67,1:25:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.53,1:25:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不用管他，让他去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about him. Let him go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.31,1:25:45.23,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的胡基人全死了，赶去东线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All these Wookiees are dead. Move to the east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.35,1:25:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.95,1:25:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,再见，塔夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Tarfful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.95,1:25:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,再见，秋巴卡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Chewbacca.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.50,1:26:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我会想你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss you I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.66,1:26:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,希望我能及时拯救一部分绝地武士…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopefully we'll be able to intercept a few Jedi...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.12,1:26:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,在他们卷入这场灾难之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before they walk into this catastrophe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.17,1:26:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,你找到肯诺比了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you find Kenobi?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.22,1:26:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,长官，这么高掉下去无人能存活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, no one could have survived that fall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.18,1:26:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,让你的人上飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start loading your men on the ships.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.64,1:27:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.43,1:27:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,九一三号紧急代码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emergency code 913.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.55,1:27:37.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我在所有频段都联系不上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no contact on any frequency.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.18,1:27:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,肯诺比长老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Kenobi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.73,1:27:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 重复 - 肯诺比长老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Repeat. - Master Kenobi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.81,1:27:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,欧甘纳参议员，我的克隆人部队伏击我，我需要帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senator Organa. My clone troops turned on me. I need help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.73,1:27:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚刚救出了尤达长老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We havejust rescued Master Yoda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.74,1:27:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,这种都有人遭到暗算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears this ambush has happened everywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.95,1:27:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我们把坐标传给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're sending you our coordinates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.83,1:28:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,嘘！轻一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hush! Not so loud.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.83,1:28:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？我听说有人袭击了绝地圣殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right? I heard there was an attack on the Jedi temple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.96,1:28:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- 从这里都能看见冒出来的烟 - 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You could see the smoke from here. - I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.46,1:28:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我来看看你和孩子是否安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came to see if you and the baby are safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.47,1:28:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.97,1:28:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,绝地武士想颠覆共和国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Jedi have tried to overthrow the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.81,1:28:19.68,Default,,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.81,1:28:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我亲眼看到云度大师试图刺杀议长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw Master Windu attempt to assassinate the chancellor myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.15,1:28:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金，你打算怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Anakin. What are you gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.66,1:28:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会背叛共和国…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not betray the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.83,1:28:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我效忠于议长…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My loyalties lie with the chancellor...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.92,1:28:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,参议院… 和你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and with the senate and with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.42,1:28:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那欧比旺呢？ - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about Obi-Wan? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.38,1:28:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,许多绝地武士已被处决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many Jedi have been killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.59,1:28:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能希望他仍忠于议长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can only hope that he's remained loyal to the chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.51,1:28:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金，我害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin, I'm afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.85,1:29:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我，我的爱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have faith, my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.02,1:29:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切很快就会变好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything will soon be set right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.11,1:29:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,议长交给我一件非常重要的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chancellor has given me a very important mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.32,1:29:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,分裂主义分子现在聚集在木塔法星系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The separatists have gathered on the Mustafar system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.91,1:29:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去那里结束这场战争 等我回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going there to end this war. Wait for me until I return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.87,1:29:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证，一切都会不同的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things will be different. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.09,1:29:29.04,Default,,0,0,0,,请等我回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, wait for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.13,1:29:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他承受着很大的压力，R2\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he is under a lot of stress, R2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.10,1:29:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,保重，我的小朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take care, my little friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.31,1:29:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,夫人，有什么我能效劳的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my lady, is there anything I might do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.11,1:29:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不用，谢谢你，3PO\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, thank you, 3PO.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.03,1:29:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我感到很无助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel so helpless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.01,1:30:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,还有多少绝地武士生还？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many other Jedi have managed to survive?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.77,1:30:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还没有消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heard from no one have we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.19,1:30:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见成千上万的军队攻击绝地圣殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw thousands of troops attack the Jedi temple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.40,1:30:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我才来找尤达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I went looking for Yoda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.40,1:30:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,圣殿里的人有消息么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have we had any contact from the temple?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.95,1:30:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们收到了一条加密的撤退讯息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Received a coded retreat message we have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.78,1:30:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,要求所有的绝地武士回到圣殿里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It requests all Jedi to return to the temple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.16,1:30:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 讯息说战争结束了 - 那么我们必须得回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It says the war is over. - Then we must go back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.71,1:30:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有任何士兵掉队了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If there are any stragglers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.46,1:30:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会落进陷阱而被杀的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they will fall into the trap and be killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.38,1:30:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你是想去撤销那个加密信号？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Suggest dismantling the coded signal, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.26,1:30:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是的，长老，我们冒不起这个险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Master. There is too much at stake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.10,1:30:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I agree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.76,1:31:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,多知道一些事会让我们的前途更光明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a little more knowledge might light our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.33,1:31:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,计划如你所预料的正在顺利进行，我的主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The plan has gone as you had promised, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.88,1:31:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,干的不错，总督\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have done well, Viceroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.75,1:31:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我的新徒弟，达斯·维德到了以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When my new apprentice Darth Vader arrives...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.68,1:31:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他会关照你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he will take care of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.57,1:31:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们从议长办公室收到一条讯息，长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're receiving a message from the chancellor's office, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.07,1:31:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 接过来 - 好的，长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Send it through. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.74,1:32:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,欧甘纳参议员，共和国最高议长要求你出席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Senator Organa, the supreme chancellor requests your presence...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.54,1:32:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,议会的特别会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at a special session of Congress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.62,1:32:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我会去的 - 他会恭候您的到来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I will be there. - He'll be expecting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.17,1:32:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这可能是个陷阱 - 我觉得不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Could be a trap. - I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.55,1:32:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,议长是没有办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chancellor will not be able to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.09,1:32:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,控制上千之众的星系的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}control the thousands of star systems...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:16.76,1:32:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,除非参议院保持不变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without keeping the senate intact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.52,1:32:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,有这个特别会议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If a special session of Congress there is...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.94,1:32:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,更方便我们进入绝地圣殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}easier for us to enter the Jedi temple it will be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.73,1:33:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,R2…呆在飞船这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}R2, stay with the ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.13,1:33:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎，维德勋爵，恭候大驾已多时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome, Lord Vader. We've been expecting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.00,1:34:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,绝地武士的叛变已经被挫败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the Jedi rebellion has been foiled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:11.63,1:34:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.80,1:34:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,议长正在解释说…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chancellor's been elaborating on...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.05,1:34:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,绝地武士阴谋推翻参议院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a plot by the Jedi to overthrow the senate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.43,1:34:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,余下的绝地武士会被追剿并打败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The remaining Jedi will be hunted down and defeated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.70,1:34:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,连幼徒们也没放过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not even the younglings survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.29,1:34:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这名弟子不是被克隆兵杀死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killed not by clones this Padawan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.67,1:34:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是激光剑刺死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By a lightsabre he was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.18,1:34:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:59.85,1:35:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这是谁干的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who could have done this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.45,1:35:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,针对我的刺杀行动…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The attempt on my life...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.74,1:35:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,让我留下伤痕、容颜尽毁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has left me scarred and deformed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:21.58,1:35:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I assure you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.58,1:35:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我的决心从来没有这么坚定过！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My resolve has never been stronger!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.51,1:35:34.71,Default,,0,0,0,,住手！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.69,1:35:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,为了保证社会的安全和长期稳定…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In order to ensure the security and continuing stability...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.45,1:35:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,共和国将重组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Republic will be reorganized...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.45,1:36:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,成为第一个银河帝国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into the first Galactic Empire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:03.83,1:36:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,为了一个安全而稳定的社会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a safe and secure society.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.10,1:36:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,自由就是这样死去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this is how liberty dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.89,1:36:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,伴随着雷鸣般的掌声…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With thunderous applause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.02,1:36:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,战争结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The war is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.32,1:36:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,西迪厄斯大人保证给我们和平的，我们只想要…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Sidious promised us peace. We only want...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.58,1:36:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我重新调校了信号，警告所有幸存的武士别回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have recalibrated the code, warning all surviving Jedi to stay away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.38,1:36:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对于克隆兵来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the clones...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.92,1:36:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,要发现信号被改过了还要很久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to discover the recalibration a long time it will take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.35,1:37:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,等等，长老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait. Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.36,1:37:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,有些事我必须弄明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is something I must know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.83,1:37:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果去看保安录像，你发现的只会是痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If into the security recordings you go, only pain will you find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.37,1:37:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须知道真相，长老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must know the truth, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.72,1:37:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.76,1:37:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can't be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.76,1:37:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,做得漂亮，我的新徒弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have done well, my new apprentice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.93,1:37:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,现在，维德勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, Lord Vader...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:43.06,1:37:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,去给帝国带来和平吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}go and bring peace to the Empire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.69,1:37:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't watch any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.61,1:37:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须消灭西斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy the Sith we must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.32,1:37:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,派我去刺杀西迪厄斯皇吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send me to kill the emperor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:57.53,1:37:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,对阿纳金我下不了手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not kill Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.91,1:38:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,去杀西迪厄斯，你还不够强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To fight this Lord Sidious, strong enough you are not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.75,1:38:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他就像我的兄弟… 我下不了手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is like my brother. I cannot do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.75,1:38:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,年轻的天行者已经被黑暗势力扭曲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twisted by the dark side young Skywalker has become.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:13.93,1:38:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你训导的那个孩子，已经不在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The boy you trained, gone he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.43,1:38:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,取而代之的是达斯·维德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consumed by Darth Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.43,1:38:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道西迪厄斯把他派到哪里去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not know where the emperor has sent him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.56,1:38:25.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道到哪去找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know where to look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.11,1:38:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,用你的感应，欧比旺，你会找到他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Use your feelings, Obi-Wan, and find him you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.33,1:38:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你最后一次看到他是什么时候？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When was the last time you saw him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.04,1:38:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- 昨天 - 你知道他现在在哪儿么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yesterday. - And do you know where he is now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.79,1:38:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.59,1:38:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,帕德美，我需要你的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Padme, I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.64,1:38:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他现在非常危险 - 因为西斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He is in grave danger. - From the Sith?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.06,1:38:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.07,1:39:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,帕德美…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Padme...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:03.98,1:39:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金已经投向黑暗势力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin has turned to the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.48,1:39:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你弄错了！你怎么能那么说？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wrong. How could you even say that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:12.74,1:39:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到一段全息安保录象… 记录他…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have seen a security hologram... of him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.37,1:39:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,怎样屠杀了幼徒们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}killing younglings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.20,1:39:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能是阿纳金，他不会那么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not Anakin. He couldn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.00,1:39:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他被谎言蒙蔽了，我们都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was deceived by a lie. We all were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.17,1:39:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,这一切都是议长的阴谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears that the chancellor is behind everything,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.14,1:39:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,包括战争在内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including the war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.76,1:39:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,帕尔帕丁就是我们一直在找的西斯君主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Palpatine is the Sith lord we've been looking for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:36.60,1:39:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,在杜库伯爵死后，阿纳金成了他的新徒弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After the death of Count Dooku, Anakin became his new apprentice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.90,1:39:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我不信…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.28,1:39:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.63,1:39:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,帕德美…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Padme...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.95,1:40:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须找到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.33,1:40:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你要去杀死他，是么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to kill him, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.38,1:40:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他已经成为一个非常大的威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has become a very great threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.47,1:40:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.65,1:40:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金是孩子的爸爸，对么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin is the father, isn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.99,1:40:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我很难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.08,1:41:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- 女士，让我和你一起去  - 没有危险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Milady, let me come with you. - There's no danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.34,1:41:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,战斗结束了，只是点私事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fighting's over. And this is personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.42,1:41:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,如你所愿，女士，但我强烈反对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you wish, milady, but I strongly disagree.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.92,1:41:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会有事的，船长，有些事我必须亲自去做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be all right, Captain. This is something I must do myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:35.68,1:41:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,而且3PO会照顾我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, 3PO will look after me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.31,1:41:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.74,1:41:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,知道吗？我发现自己…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know? I think I'm beginning to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.55,1:41:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,开始掌握飞行技术了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get the hang of this flying business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.73,1:42:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,分裂分子已经被我消灭了，师傅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The separatists have been taken care of, my master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.28,1:42:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你的任务完成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is finished then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.57,1:42:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你把和平和正义又带回到了星系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have restored peace and justice to the galaxy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.16,1:42:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,向贸易联盟的舰队发条消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send a message to the ships of the Trade Federation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.21,1:42:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,所有机器人军团要立即关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All droid units must shut down immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.55,1:42:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,很好，主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.78,1:43:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到了你的飞船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw your ship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.70,1:43:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你来这干吗？ - 我好担心你啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing out here? - I was so worried about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:01.16,1:44:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,欧比旺告诉了我一些可怕的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obi-Wan told me terrible things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.12,1:44:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.38,1:44:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他说你投靠了黑暗势力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said you've turned to the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.42,1:44:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,并且你…还杀死了幼徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That you... killed younglings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.59,1:44:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,欧比旺是想让你对付我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obi-Wan is trying to turn you against me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.39,1:44:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,他是关心我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He cares about us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.98,1:44:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:22.27,1:44:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,他知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.10,1:44:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他想帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.82,1:44:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金，我要的只是你的爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin, all I want is your love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.20,1:44:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,爱救不了你，帕德美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Love won't save you, Padm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.66,1:44:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- 只有我的新力量能救你 - 那值得么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Only my new powers can do that. - At what cost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.00,1:44:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你是个好人，别这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a good person. Don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.50,1:44:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会像失去我母亲一样失去你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't lose you the way I lost my mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.33,1:44:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在比任何绝地武士所梦想过的都要强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am becoming more powerful than any Jedi has ever dreamed of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.67,1:44:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我这么做是为了你，为了保护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm doing it for you. To protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.80,1:44:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,和我一起走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come away with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.51,1:44:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,和我一起把孩子养大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me raise our child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.64,1:45:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,在事情不可收拾前，离开这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave everything else behind while we still can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.56,1:45:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你没看出来么？我们不需要再逃避了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you see? We don't have to run away any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.31,1:45:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我给共和国带来了和平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have brought peace to the Republic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.86,1:45:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我比议长更有力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am more powerful than the chancellor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.90,1:45:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以推翻他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can overthrow him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:16.07,1:45:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们就可以一起控制整个星系了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And together, you and I can rule the galaxy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.24,1:45:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想怎样就怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}make things the way we want them to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.00,1:45:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't believe what I'm hearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.51,1:45:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,欧比旺没错，你变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obi-Wan was right. You've changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.01,1:45:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再听到欧比旺的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to hear any more about Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.72,1:45:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,绝地武士背叛了我，你不可以背叛我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Jedi turned against me. Don't you turn against me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.86,1:45:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我不认得你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know you any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.75,1:45:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:51.57,1:45:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你伤透了我的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're breaking my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.24,1:45:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你走的这条路我跟不上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going down a path I can't follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.20,1:46:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为欧比旺？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because of Obi-Wan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.87,1:46:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为你所做的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because of what you've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.08,1:46:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you plan to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.25,1:46:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,现在停手，回头吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop. Stop now. Come back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.00,1:46:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 - 骗子！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I love you. - Liar!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:14.07,1:46:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.76,1:46:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你是和他一伙的，你把他带过来杀我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're with him! You brought him here to kill me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.98,1:46:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,放开她，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.77,1:46:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,放开她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let her go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:38.95,1:46:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你唆使她背叛了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You turned her against me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:42.58,1:46:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,是你自作自受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have done that yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.50,1:46:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能把她从我身边夺走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not take her from me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.80,1:46:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你的愤怒和对权力的渴望已经迫使她离开你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your anger and your lust for power have already done that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.60,1:47:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你让这黑暗的邪王吞噬你的思想…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have allowed this dark lord to twist your mind...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.52,1:47:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,直到现在你变成了你曾发誓要消灭的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until now you have become the very thing you swore to destroy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.82,1:47:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,别和我讲道理，欧比旺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't lecture me, Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.82,1:47:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我看透了绝地武士的谎言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see through the lies of the Jedi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.45,1:47:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我不像你那么惧怕黑暗势力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not fear the dark side as you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.66,1:47:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我给新的帝国带来了和平…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have brought peace...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:20.70,1:47:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,自由，正义和安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}freedom, justice and security to my new empire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.46,1:47:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你的新帝国？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your new empire?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.42,1:47:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,别逼我杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make me kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:32.84,1:47:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金，我只对共和国制度效忠，忠于民主！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin, my allegiance is to the Republic, to democracy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.22,1:47:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你的立场和我不同…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're not with me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.10,1:47:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就是我的敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you're my enemy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.02,1:47:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,只有西斯的思维才这么极端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only a Sith deals in absolutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:50.03,1:47:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我得履新职责了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will do what I must.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.61,1:47:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你可以试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will try.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:26.77,1:48:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,陛下，我听说你有了个新徒弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear a new apprentice you have, Emperor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:30.90,1:48:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,或许应该叫你达斯·西迪厄斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or should I call you Darth Sidious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:35.49,1:48:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,尤达长老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Yoda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.20,1:48:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:40.75,1:48:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,很惊讶么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surprised?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.83,1:48:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,傲慢蒙蔽了你，尤达长老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your arrogance blinds you, Master Yoda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.54,1:48:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,现在让你领教一下…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you will experience...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:49.71,1:48:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,黑暗原力的全部能量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the full power of the dark side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.14,1:49:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我等这一刻已经很久了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have waited a long time for this moment...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.93,1:49:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我的绿色小朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my little green friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.33,1:50:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,终于，绝地武士终于一个不剩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last the Jedi are no more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:00.91,1:50:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,只要我还活着就别说大话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if anything to say about it I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.46,1:50:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,你的统治就要结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At an end your rule is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:14.68,1:50:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,它已经够长的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And not short enough it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:21.89,1:50:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你真的那么强大…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If so powerful you are...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:25.35,1:50:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,干吗要跑呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:27.77,1:50:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你阻止不了我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not stop me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:30.44,1:50:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,达斯·维德会比我们俩都要强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darth Vader will become more powerful than either of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.16,1:50:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你高估了你的新徒弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faith in your new apprentice misplaced may be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:40.83,1:50:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,正如你高估了黑暗原力一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As is your faith in the dark side of the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:12.53,1:55:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,快点，时间要恰到好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry. Careful timing we will need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.37,1:55:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了就发射你的归航信标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activate your homing beacon when you're ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.28,1:55:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没找到他的尸体，长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no sign of his body, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:20.75,1:55:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那么他没死 - 再搜查一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Then he is not dead. - Double your search.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:24.50,1:55:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,好的，长官，马上就去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. Right away, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:27.84,1:55:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,叫卡基船长去准备我的舰船立即起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell Captain Kagi to prepare my shuttle for immediate take-off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.05,1:55:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的，主人 - 我感觉到维德勋爵有麻烦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes, Master. - I sense Lord Vader is in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.96,1:56:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能再回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Into exile I must go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:49.84,1:56:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Failed I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:31.36,1:58:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你失望了，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have failed you, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:33.40,1:58:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我让你失望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have failed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:35.41,1:58:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我早该知道绝地武士在策反了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have known the Jedi were plotting to take over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:38.41,1:58:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金，帕尔帕丁议长是邪恶的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anakin, Chancellor Palpatine is evil!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:41.33,1:58:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,从我的角度来说，绝地武士才是邪恶的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From my point of view, the Jedi are evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.08,1:58:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,那么你的确迷失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you are lost!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.55,1:59:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是你的末日，我的老师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the end for you, my master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.58,1:59:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,战斗结束了，阿纳金，我占据了高地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over, Anakin. I have the high ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:30.38,1:59:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你低估了我的实力！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You underestimate my power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.84,1:59:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不要尝试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't try it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.45,2:00:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,你是被选中的那个人！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were the chosen one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.91,2:00:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,预言说你会消灭西斯，而不是加入他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was said that you would destroy the Sith, not join them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.75,2:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,给原力以平衡，不是将它领入黑暗！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring balance to the Force, not leave it in darkness!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.23,2:00:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我恨你！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.99,2:00:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你曾经是我的兄弟，阿纳金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were my brother, Anakin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:37.33,2:00:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾那么关心你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I loved you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:20.70,2:01:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,肯诺比长老 帕德美小姐在船上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Kenobi. We have Miss Padme on board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:23.75,2:01:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,对，请快一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Please, please hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:25.96,2:01:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得离开这可怕的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should leave this dreadful place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:40.06,2:01:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,欧比旺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obi-Wan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:01:44.35,2:01:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,阿纳金还好么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Anakin all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:55.14,2:02:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,陛下，走这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your Majesty, this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:02:58.06,2:02:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,他在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:00.06,2:03:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,他还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:05.23,2:03:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,叫一个医疗舱过来，快！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get a medical capsule immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.57,2:03:09.52,Default,,0,0,0,,好的，长官，现在就去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. Right away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.52,2:03:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,打扰了，尤达长老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, Master Yoda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:03:53.36,2:03:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,欧比旺·肯诺比和我们联系上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obi-Wan Kenobi has made contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:12.38,2:04:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,快把她送医疗中心，快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll take her to the medical centre. Quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.13,2:04:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,生理上，她完全健康\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Medically, she's completely healthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.46,2:04:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但因为某些未知的原因，我们就要失去她了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For reasons we can't explain, we are losing her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:52.05,2:04:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她要死了？ - 不知道为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- She's dying? - We don't know why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:54.89,2:04:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,她失去了生存的意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has lost the will to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:04:57.05,2:05:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,如果要救宝宝们，我们要马上做手术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to operate quickly if we are to save the babies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:00.31,2:05:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,宝宝们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Babies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:02.02,2:05:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是双胞胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's carrying twins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:46.06,2:05:47.52,Default,,0,0,0,,卢克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:05:55.74,2:05:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，卢克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Luke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:06:19.68,2:06:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是个女孩 - 莉娅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's a girl. - Leia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.82,2:07:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,欧比旺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Obi-Wan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:11.49,2:07:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,他还有良知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's good in him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:16.07,2:07:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:18.16,2:07:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道他… 还有…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know there's... still...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:56.99,2:07:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,维德勋爵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Vader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.79,2:08:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,能听见我说话么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:04.96,2:08:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,能，师傅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.55,2:08:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,帕德美在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Padm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:13.26,2:08:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,她安全么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:16.26,2:08:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,她还好么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.97,2:08:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎，你一怒之下杀死了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems, in your anger, you killed her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:25.56,2:08:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.57,2:08:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,她还活着！我感觉到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was alive. I felt it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:08:50.56,2:08:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:05.52,2:09:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们必须被藏在一个安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hidden, safe the children must be kept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.94,2:09:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得把他们带去一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must take them somewhere where{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:12.71,2:09:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,西斯感觉不到他们存在的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Sith will not sense their presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.03,2:09:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他们应该被分开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Split up they should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.87,2:09:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我和我妻子会抚养这个女孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wife and I will take the girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.37,2:09:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直想领养一个女婴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've always talked of adopting a baby girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.38,2:09:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,她会在我们的爱心中成长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She will be loved with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:29.55,2:09:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那男孩呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what of the boy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.47,2:09:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,送到塔图音，他的故乡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Tatooine. To his family send him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.81,2:09:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我带他去，我会照看他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will take the child and watch over him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:45.69,2:09:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,在时机成熟前，我们会暂时消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until the time is right, disappear we will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:51.19,2:09:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,肯诺比长老，等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Kenobi, wait a moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.32,2:10:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你在塔图音隐居期间，我会指导你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In your solitude on Tatooine, training I have for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:02.87,2:10:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,指导？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Training?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:04.29,2:10:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,一个老朋友学会了不朽之术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An old friend has learned the path to immortality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:10.92,2:10:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他从原力的阴间回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One who has returned from the netherworld of the Force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:14.13,2:10:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你师傅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your old master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:17.26,2:10:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,魁刚？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Qui-Gon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.27,2:10:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我会教你怎么和他交流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How to commune with him I will teach you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.02,2:10:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 安德列斯船长 - 是的，阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Captain Antilles. - Yes, Your Highness?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:28.27,2:10:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我把这些机器人交给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm placing these droids in your care.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:30.28,2:10:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好好照顾他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Treat them well. Clean them up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:32.28,2:10:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,清除他们的记忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have the protocol droid's mind wiped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:34.28,2:10:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:10:36.83,2:10:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,哦，不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
